note: Text in quotes inside a value in brackets.
a parcel has a weight and a note (text or nothing).
let box be a new parcel with weight 2 and note nothing.
say "([box's note, or "none"]) and ["a" followed by "!"]".
say "[box's weight] kg (["heavy" if box's weight is over 1, otherwise "light"])".
let names be a list of "Ann" and "Bo".
say "Guests: [names joined with " & "]."
say "[[not a value]] and ["quoted"]".
